      "category": "unavailable_training_premise",
      "runtime_bug_under_frozen_contract": false,
      "diagnosis": "Only dual IMPF sjd full base is QAC 55:6:3 yasojuda + Ani. Its verse is excluded by closure for T10 yasojuda. The frozen split already records K10 target absent after exclusions. Remaining persons/roots do not provide the required retained dual base. The authored positive expectations are wider than the retained evidence for these two cases; preserve them as documented unresolved premises, not fabricated training witnesses."
    },
    {
      "ids": [
        "INF-K04"
      ],
      "category": "plural_lemma_allomorph_coverage",
      "runtime_bug_under_frozen_contract": false,
      "diagnosis": "Source MP lemma mufoliHuwn is itself plural-form. v1 recognizes masculine plural letters only by exact singular-looking lemma recomposition; it has no independent -uuna/-iina paired-source rule. Both forms are retained. A general paired-allomorph rule can license the letter declension paradigm without claiming a singular attestation or semantic sound/broken classification."
    },
    {
      "ids": [
        "INF-B01",
        "INF-B04"
      ],
      "category": "full_suffix_chain_kind_coverage",
      "runtime_bug_under_frozen_contract": "loss of requested source-qualified full-form reading; no wrong activation",
      "diagnosis": "v1 compiles stem plus a qualified subject suffix, omitting trailing object suffix chains from transferable forms. The whole observed written run therefore loses its source-attested verb reading. A bounded exact full-chain reading can preserve kind and segmentation while keeping construction/classes unresolved."
    },
    {
      "ids": [
        "INF-B03"
      ],
      "category": "multiple_nun_position_coverage",
      "runtime_bug_under_frozen_contract": "insufficient representation",
      "diagnosis": "A scalar entry.nun retains five_verb_raf but cannot keep a second radical nun and its independent position. The root and full plural source form are attested. Two labels collected across different alternative readings would not satisfy the correlated positional requirement."
    },
    {
      "ids": [
        "INF-B05",
        "INF-B06"
      ],
      "category": "emphasis_candidate_coverage",
      "runtime_bug_under_frozen_contract": "overbroad withholding of source-qualified kind/evidence",
      "diagnosis": "v1 skips any source entry with an EMPH suffix. This avoids guessing directness but also discards its source-attested verb kind and emphatic suffix candidate. Retain exact full-form source evidence while keeping construction/classes/directness unresolved."
    }
  ],
